{"ofc-s46-67171":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんお久しぶりです\nブログの書き方を忘れてしまって\n苦戦しました…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Buddies感謝祭 のお話を。\n9月10月は皆さんの前でパフォーマンスを\nさせていただく機会がなかったので\nかなり久しぶりの櫻坂単独ライブでしたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブは久しぶりに\n披露させていただく曲が多かったです\n車間距離だったり一瞬の馬だったり。\n美しきNervousも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初披露の楽曲もありましたね\n夜空で一番輝いている星の名前を僕はまだ知らない　という曲。\n音ハメが気持ち良い振り付けなので、\nリピート配信で是非注目していただきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、二期生さん楽曲の　青空が見えるまで\nも初披露でした\n二期生さんが楽しそうで\nわたしまで嬉しくなっちゃう曲。\n二期生さんが楽しそうなのが一番嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobcHv83i.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobsSnUi3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobUlBl7J.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobfsBTNB.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人一人の事がだーーいすき\nメンバーも皆さんもスタッフさんも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobL5P60z.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mob08hsWO.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mob3mH5VH.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobq4WEqM.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202512/mobqxdFWX.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短めのリハーサル期間だったけど\n毎